test/reject/types/closure_lending_hints_ownership.rig outer prod-rejects prod-strict `|<f|` of a `?fun` parameter

# A closure's loans end with its last use, deferred code included; the
# compiler holds them wherever deferred code mentions the closure, or
# where its environment needs a drop.
