# before (Core s6): the compiler's statement temporaries (Core §3).
test/reject/ownership/call_write_lend_kept.rig match_arm_writes prod-rejects prod-strict `!v.push(Item(n: it.n))` in an arm of `match find(!v)`, after the last use of `it`
